
[l_english.DECISION_CATEGORY_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE]
Seeking New Trade Partners

[l_english.DECISION_CATEGORY_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE_desc]
Unfortunately, the Rock Farm not only lacks a seaport, but its political environment also makes it difficult for us to find any normal non-Imperial trading partners which near the farm. Perhaps that’s exactly why the Imperial Order Department feels confident they can easily manipulate us — after all, they’ve long controlled the pricing power through their position.\n\nHowever, if we can put our earth pony spirit to good use, we might be able to carve out some unimaginable new routes to solve our problem.

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_CATEGORY_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE]
寻找新的贸易伙伴

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_CATEGORY_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE_desc]
很不幸，采石农场不仅没有出海口，同时政治环境也让我们难以在我们的邻国中寻找一个正常的非帝国贸易伙伴，这或许是帝国秩序部觉得他们可以轻易拿捏我们的底气，并且在过去凭借他们的地位掌握着定价权。但是，如果我们的陆马精神能够派上用场，我们可以开辟出一些难以想象的路线来解决我们的难题
